From 645b612cb134fe5a230774fe5268f9dc92b3353b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hermes <hermes@local>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 11:23:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] tp: distributed eager forward + kimi_k3_dist_generate
 (Phase 3)

- kimi_k3_dist_forward_token: single-rank TP step via RankCollective allreduce
- kimi_k3_dist_generate: TCP coordinator/workers, NCCL InitRank, greedy sample
- CoordinatorTransport::complete_local_step/finish_ack for rank0 in-process acks
- CPU protocol dry-run test (6 checks)

Still experimental: full multi-Spark weight load + generate needs NCCL build and
330GB on each host. Graphs/WEPS off. No tok/s claim.
